  "scope": "Pinned terminfo.dev@4.0.0 paths for extensions.osc720-scroll-up preserved: the terminal path (two writes, a cursor-position query and unverifiedEffect; always inconclusive, evidence \"consumed\", and the path the stock collector grades) and the termless function (thirty fed lines, two scrollback reads and the bare OSC 720 BEL; replayed UNCHANGED over a parent-built scrollback context mapped from the App view position, which is not a termless backend run and not a stock grade), beside a separately identified effect contract graded by an independent oracle written from rxvt-unicode: OSC 720 ; Pt moves the viewing window up Pt lines and, for a zero or absent Pt (which the pinned bare form is), clears the scrollback (rxvt(7) and src/command.C scr_page / scr_erase_savelines). Observed quantities are the App view scroll position, the stored history (count, generation, evictions and content), the cursor and the screen; the wheel (a routed generated-input notch) and ED 3 are observer controls only and never evidence for OSC 720. No OSC 721, painted pixels, remote/mux, Windows/Linux, stock-score or common-harness claim.",
